      "revision": 1228380440,
      "text": "Lannea discolor, the live-long, is a plant species in the family Anacardiaceae. It is found from the DRC to Zambia, Zimbabwe, South Africa and Eswatini. It is similar in appearance to L. schweinfurthii which has a largely overlapping distribution."
